WELCOME TO THE CONFLUX
This is a threshold. What you become next is a choice, and you make it once.
@button Begin | next

RESEARCH IS PAID IN DATA
There are five kinds of it.
@item minecraft:iron_ingot | Material
@item minecraft:slime_ball | Biological
@item minecraft:redstone | Energetic
@item minecraft:comparator | Computational
@item minecraft:amethyst_shard | Arcane

THE PHOENIX
Rebirth through consumption. Every ending is an ignition.
@item minecraft:blaze_powder | Heat
@item minecraft:fire_charge | Reactions
@item minecraft:lava_bucket | Power
@button Next | next

THE SCULK
A network that remembers every death that fed it. Not a parasite: a library.
@item minecraft:sculk_catalyst | Growth
@item minecraft:sculk_sensor | Sensing
@item minecraft:echo_shard | Memory
@button Next | next

THE VOID
Before the first thing there was the space between things. It was patient.
@item minecraft:ender_eye | Sight
@item minecraft:ender_chest | Storage
@item minecraft:ender_pearl | Distance
@button Next | next

THE HUD BAR
Open your inventory: a row of small buttons runs along the top of the screen. Each opens a screen of one of the mods. Hover one to see its name.
@image phoenix_chronicles:textures/gui/chronicles_quest_book_icon.png | Quest book
@image solaris:textures/gui/suite_bar_icon.png | Map
@image phoenixcore:textures/gui/suite_conflux.png | Research
@image phoenix_continuum:textures/gui/suite_continuum.png | Star map

CONTINUUM
A map of the sky that is really there: stars, clouds and black holes you can fly to. These pictures are live, and turn as you walk round the screen.
@continuum star ffcc66 | Stars
@continuum black_hole | Black holes
@continuum gas_cloud 66aaff | Gas clouds

BODIES
Every body is drawn by shaders, not a flat picture: a star burns, a cloud glows, and a black hole bends the light behind it.
@continuum protostar ff8855 | A star being born
@continuum star 9fc4ff | A hot blue star

THE CHOICE
Your first choice is free.
@button Choose your path | open_discipline_picker
@if no_discipline

CHANGING IT LATER
You can change your path by abandoning it at a research terminal, for a cost in research data. Once you have committed it is ten times as much.
@button Choose your path | open_discipline_picker
@if no_discipline

READY?
Read the screens around you first if you have not.
@button Choose your path | open_discipline_picker
@if no_discipline

YOUR PATH
You follow {discipline}.
@button Enter your realm | command:conflux dimension enter
@if has_discipline

CHANGING YOUR PATH
Abandon it at a research terminal. It costs research data, and ten times as much once you have committed.
